WEBVTT

00:00:01.010 --> 00:00:08.190
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:14.690
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:16.530
It's my day!

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:27.100
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.570 --> 00:00:34.510
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:41.890
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.550 --> 00:00:49.290
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:55.070
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.570 --> 00:01:02.210
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.370 --> 00:01:09.710
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.410 --> 00:01:15.850
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:18.920
I just want to walk

00:01:19.260 --> 00:01:22.460
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.690 --> 00:01:26.430
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:35.340
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:41.780
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.780 --> 00:01:44.050
It's my day!

00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:53.420
Tsukushi!

00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:55.660
Huh?

00:01:59.160 --> 00:02:00.530
<i>It can't be...</i>

00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:04.300
I transferred here.
Good to see you.

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:04.870
<i>No way...</i>

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:07.470
<i>How can this be?</i>

00:02:08.470 --> 00:02:12.140
I just never wanted to be
separated from Tsukasa.

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:18.250
<i>You don't say...</i>

00:02:19.050 --> 00:02:25.660
"The Shockwave of New Student Shigeru!"

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:34.070
Ah! There he is!

00:02:35.030 --> 00:02:35.970
Tsukasa!

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:40.570
Stop clinging to me! Get off!

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:42.370
I said get off!

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:46.110
Huh?

00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:50.620
Hiya.

00:02:51.650 --> 00:02:52.350
You...

00:02:53.350 --> 00:02:56.120
What are you doing here?
And that uniform...

00:03:07.600 --> 00:03:10.640
I transferred. How do I look?

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:13.140
Transferred?

00:03:13.740 --> 00:03:16.140
Well, I always want
to be with you.

00:03:18.340 --> 00:03:19.040
What?

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:22.010
That's a rich young lady, for you...

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:25.900
Seems there's nothing you can't do
if you've got enough money.

00:03:25.900 --> 00:03:27.890
This monkey girl's no lady!

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:32.360
But you had a nice time at the hot springs
with that monkey girl...

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:33.160
Shut up!

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:35.690
I don't want to hear
another word out of you!

00:03:36.060 --> 00:03:38.800
Besides, it was all her fault.

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:41.930
This stupid monkey stripped off
her clothes and got on me...

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:12.960
<i>Great. Now, every time
I go to school,</i>

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:16.600
<i>I get to see them
acting all lovey-dovey...</i>

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:19.000
Say, Tsukasa...

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:21.110
Stop clinging to me!

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:38.860
<i>I loved you...
How could you? It's awful...</i>

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:55.270
Can't I stay near you?
I won't cause any trouble.

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:58.880
Are you crazy?

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:06.080
I know... But I still love you.

00:05:16.630 --> 00:05:21.670
<i>What's with that Domyoji?
His tongue's hanging out.</i>

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:25.170
<i>Of course, it's got nothing
to do with me.</i>

00:05:38.020 --> 00:05:41.990
<i>What? Why are you
looking at me like that?</i>

00:05:42.890 --> 00:05:43.960
<i>I'm nothing to you!</i>

00:05:54.270 --> 00:05:58.540
<i>Why should I worry
about something like this, anyway?</i>

00:06:02.110 --> 00:06:03.470
Say, did you hear?

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:06.900
Yes. Just leave it to the daughter
of the powerful Okawahara Zaibatsu.

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:09.050
She doesn't fool around.

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:11.730
To go through the trouble
of transferring here...

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:14.280
...just because she doesn't want
to be away from Domyoji...

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:18.520
Yeah. And the way they carried on
in the cafeteria... I'm so jealous.

00:06:19.720 --> 00:06:25.300
But she's the perfect match
for Domyoji, isn't she?

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:28.880
That's right.
If he'd wound up with Makino Tsukushi...

00:06:28.880 --> 00:06:32.440
...it would have been
downright embarrassing.

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:37.410
I've got an idea.

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:41.650
Why don't we get back at Makino?

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:52.990
Looks like Domyoji's finally
going to quit fighting it.

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:57.730
Tsukushi is finally free
from that ruffian.

00:06:58.630 --> 00:07:00.350
What she probably needs now...

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:04.240
...is the tender support
of a big-hearted person like me.

00:07:06.270 --> 00:07:10.810
Now, maybe, she'll realize
what a treasure I am.

00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:12.380
Right, Sanjo?

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:18.520
Sanjo?

00:07:25.990 --> 00:07:27.460
Hold on there, Makino.

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:50.480
What do you want?

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:56.720
I'm shocked you can stay here
after all that's happened.

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:10.900
Domyoji is engaged
to Shigeru Okawahara...

00:08:11.270 --> 00:08:14.110
...and she's even transferred
to this school.

00:08:14.440 --> 00:08:19.610
Maybe ordinary people like you
have thicker skins?

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:25.520
<i>It's true. It's just not worth
getting infuriated over.</i>

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:33.830
You ought to know that there's no place
for you at this school.

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:38.830
For an instant, Domyoji took an interest
in a pauper like you...

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:41.900
Be thankful you got that much.

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:44.700
<i>What?</i>

00:08:47.410 --> 00:08:51.440
You've dreamed a sweet dream.
Wake up and go back to your pauper's life.

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:58.020
It's true.
I'm just a pauper, a weed.

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:01.650
But I don't need to be told...

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:04.560
...by jerks like you!

00:09:11.830 --> 00:09:13.360
Hey, what are you doing?

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:15.130
Shigeru?

00:09:15.130 --> 00:09:16.500
Miss Okawahara?

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:19.970
Do you know her?

00:09:20.340 --> 00:09:23.210
Of course. She's my best friend.

00:09:24.940 --> 00:09:25.880
<i>Best friend?</i>

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:28.680
Best friend?

00:09:29.350 --> 00:09:32.020
Best friend?
But, Miss Okawahara...

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:37.520
As a fellow student,
I must warn you, Miss Okawahara...

00:09:38.820 --> 00:09:42.460
You had better choose your friends
more carefully.

00:09:43.260 --> 00:09:47.030
That's right. You could bring shame
to the Okawahara name.

00:09:47.970 --> 00:09:49.170
What do you mean?

00:09:49.700 --> 00:09:54.170
A rich girl like you shouldn't be friends
with a pauper like her.

00:09:54.970 --> 00:09:56.970
Is it wrong for me to be rich?!

00:09:57.640 --> 00:09:59.240
No, that's not what I mean...

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:01.750
You don't understand, 
Miss Okawahara!

00:10:02.050 --> 00:10:05.280
Tsukushi is my most precious friend!

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:11.280
Now, you wouldn't be saying
awful things to my good friend...

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:14.330
...to try to bully her, would you?

00:10:14.660 --> 00:10:15.460
What?

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:17.250
Nothing like...

00:10:17.250 --> 00:10:20.730
"I'm shocked you can stay here
after all that has happened."

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:26.060
Or, "For an instant, Domyoji took
an interest in a pauper like you..."

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:28.570
"...Be thankful you got that much."

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:31.180
Or, "You've dreamed a sweet dream."

00:10:32.410 --> 00:10:34.880
You wouldn't say anything
like that, would you?

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:41.090
No, well, we were just doing it
for you and Domyoji...

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:47.490
My, how kind!
But no thanks for small favors!

00:10:47.490 --> 00:10:50.460
Oh, well if you say so...

00:10:51.360 --> 00:10:54.900
You're off the hook for now, Makino!

00:10:55.830 --> 00:10:57.770
Hey, that's <i>my</i> line!

00:10:57.770 --> 00:11:01.770
If you do anything more to her,
I'll make sure you're expelled!

00:11:02.370 --> 00:11:06.640
But, Miss Okawahara...
We didn't mean...

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:08.510
Shoo! Shoo!

00:11:08.910 --> 00:11:09.880
Y-yes, ma'am!

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:13.990
Thank you, Shigeru.

00:11:14.390 --> 00:11:16.420
No. I should apologize.

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:21.140
If you're having trouble
because of me...

00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:23.800
I don't know how to apologize.

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:28.580
If you have any more trouble,
please let me know.

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:31.670
I promise to protect you!

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:36.770
<i>What beautiful hands...</i>

00:11:38.940 --> 00:11:41.850
Oops, I'd better hurry,
or I'll be late for my next class.

00:11:42.280 --> 00:11:43.760
Oh, I'm sorry. Go on!

00:11:43.760 --> 00:11:44.520
Bye!

00:11:47.050 --> 00:11:51.360
Tsukushi, remember!
If anything happens, tell me!

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:52.860
It's a promise!

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:05.740
<i>Why does Shigeru treat me so well?</i>

00:12:07.940 --> 00:12:09.670
<i>Best friends?</i>

00:12:34.070 --> 00:12:36.300
Tsukushi Makino

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:36.300
What's this?

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:49.280
<i>Makino.</i>

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:52.820
<i>Please meet me on the roof
after school...</i>

00:12:54.820 --> 00:12:55.890
<i>I'll be waiting.</i>

00:12:57.860 --> 00:12:58.890
<i>Sakurako.</i>

00:13:29.250 --> 00:13:30.620
Can I help you?

00:13:43.970 --> 00:13:47.840
<i>Why so tense? What's going on?</i>

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:53.210
Makino, thanks for coming.
Stand there and watch us.

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:56.950
Watch? Watch what?

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:02.950
Miss Okawahara...
I won't let you have Domyoji.

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:09.260
I've loved him since kindergarten.

00:14:09.590 --> 00:14:13.350
That's why I've done
everything in my power

00:14:13.350 --> 00:14:15.430
to make him turn my way.

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:21.090
But when Makino came
on the scene,

00:14:21.090 --> 00:14:25.210
I thought I had lost.
I could never beat her.

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:30.550
That's why I gave up on Domyoji.

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:32.970
<i>Sakurako...</i>

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:36.490
But that was only because
it was Makino.

00:14:36.950 --> 00:14:38.270
Miss Okawahara...

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:41.190
I cannot let you have Domyoji! Never!

00:14:43.490 --> 00:14:46.960
I'll take him back from you!

00:14:56.510 --> 00:14:57.480
Are you listening?

00:14:58.380 --> 00:14:59.410
Yes, I am.

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:01.780
This is so interesting!

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:04.020
What?

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:08.420
This really is interesting,
isn't it, Tsukushi?

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:10.120
Huh? W-what?

00:15:11.360 --> 00:15:14.290
This school is more interesting
than I expected.

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:16.630
It's fun!

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:18.960
F-fun?

00:15:24.970 --> 00:15:26.200
You're cute.

00:15:29.340 --> 00:15:32.440
I love people like you!

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:46.860
<i>Shigeru Okawahara...
She sure is something.</i>

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:56.000
<i>To think she had both Asai and Sakurako
at a loss for words...</i>

00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:59.340
<i>Is she shrewd, or
just naturally absentminded?</i>

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:04.440
<i>Either way... 
I could never match her.</i>

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:14.390
Sorry.

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:21.760
Shigeru Okawahara has
transferred here?

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:25.430
Didn't you know?
The whole school's buzzing.

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:27.470
I didn't know.

00:16:29.230 --> 00:16:30.000
Good grief.

00:16:31.370 --> 00:16:33.810
<i>This guy is really weird.</i>

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:37.440
<i>He was in such a serious mood
the other day...</i>

00:16:37.440 --> 00:16:39.580
<i>and today, he's his usual self.</i>

00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:43.550
<i>It's like there's a different wind
blowing around him.</i>

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:45.380
What about Tsukasa?

00:16:48.750 --> 00:16:50.050
How's Tsukasa taking this?

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:56.430
He's drooling all over her.
Such an idiot.

00:16:58.130 --> 00:16:58.800
Does it bother you?

00:16:59.130 --> 00:16:59.960
Of course not!

00:17:00.800 --> 00:17:04.470
I'm completely over him.
It feels great!

00:17:08.810 --> 00:17:10.310
What's so funny?

00:17:17.750 --> 00:17:21.690
Well, it is funny...
You're always so funny.

00:17:25.890 --> 00:17:27.090
Always?

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:30.060
Well pardon me...
for always being funny!

00:17:32.460 --> 00:17:35.930
<i>Oh... I'm laughing.</i>

00:17:36.770 --> 00:17:39.800
<i>I guess I've been uptight
all this time.</i>

00:17:43.940 --> 00:17:48.310
<i>When I'm with Rui Hanazawa,
I feel relaxed, I guess.</i>

00:17:49.280 --> 00:17:52.250
<i>As long as he's here,
I can go on.</i>

00:17:53.250 --> 00:17:56.090
<i>And I don't have to think
about those two...</i>

00:17:57.290 --> 00:17:58.260
Tsukushi!

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:01.030
<i>That voice!</i>

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:05.600
<i>Agh! Shigeru!</i>

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:10.670
Oh, if it isn't
Tsukushi's boyfriend!

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:12.500
Nice to see you again.

00:18:16.810 --> 00:18:18.580
You seem very well.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:19.730
Yes.

00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:22.280
I've just transferred to this school.

00:18:23.680 --> 00:18:26.120
What was your name, again?

00:18:26.550 --> 00:18:27.650
Rui Hanazawa.

00:18:28.050 --> 00:18:31.290
Oh, that's right.
It was a name like that.

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:33.660
May I call you Rui?

00:18:34.290 --> 00:18:35.360
Sure.

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:39.360
What is it you like about Rui?

00:18:40.230 --> 00:18:45.540
Shigeru, I...
Rui Hanazawa and I aren't...

00:18:46.940 --> 00:18:48.290
You say that...

00:18:48.290 --> 00:18:51.240
but you did spend
a night together, didn't you?

00:19:00.650 --> 00:19:06.260
<i>Yes. That night...
Rui Hanazawa and I...</i>

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:09.530
<i>held hands...</i>

00:19:10.860 --> 00:19:13.900
<i>and we slept together,
side by side.</i>

00:19:15.330 --> 00:19:16.270
<i>But...</i>

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:19.300
<i>Domyoji and Shigeru...</i>

00:19:29.610 --> 00:19:32.020
See? You're blushing.

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:34.650
Tsukushi's not as innocent
as she seems.

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:36.540
I know what!

00:19:36.540 --> 00:19:39.760
Why don't the four of us go
on a trip or something?

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:41.560
Whoa... Just a minute!

00:19:43.260 --> 00:19:45.460
It's fine with me as long as
there's a hot spring bath.

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:47.730
Haven't you had enough?!

00:19:48.030 --> 00:19:49.100
We're there!

00:19:49.100 --> 00:19:51.500
In that case,
how about going to Nasu?

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:52.940
Sounds good.

00:19:53.270 --> 00:19:54.410
Don't you think so?

00:19:54.410 --> 00:19:56.740
Come on! Don't get so excited!

00:19:57.080 --> 00:20:02.050
Maybe, it'll be
Tsukasa's and my honeymoon!

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:07.440
<i>That's not funny!</i>

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:11.820
<i>Why should I have to go with Domyoji
on his honeymoon?!</i>

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:16.030
Oh, dear...
My face is burning. Whew!

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:31.440
Rui...

00:20:40.590 --> 00:20:41.350
Rui!

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:46.160
Shizuka?

00:21:06.380 --> 00:21:09.250
<i>Shizuka? Why...?</i>

00:21:39.740 --> 00:21:42.250
Rui, I've come for you.

00:21:58.000 --> 00:22:04.600
Will I ever make it that far?

00:22:04.600 --> 00:22:09.350
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:22:11.170 --> 00:22:18.820
Some day, the whole world

00:22:18.820 --> 00:22:24.630
will have its eyes on me.

00:22:24.630 --> 00:22:32.380
Yeah, after our graduation ceremony

00:22:32.380 --> 00:22:38.000
we all wrote our dreams on the wall.

00:22:38.000 --> 00:22:44.620
A lot of time has passed since then

00:22:44.620 --> 00:22:51.020
but I'm just the same as I was on that day!

00:22:51.020 --> 00:22:57.920
Keep trying your best! 
Wishes can come true!

00:22:57.920 --> 00:23:06.800
Let's keep running down
 the road we believe in!

00:23:08.080 --> 00:23:14.710
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:14.710 --> 00:23:20.770
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:21.310 --> 00:23:28.030
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:28.030 --> 00:23:31.420
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:31.420 --> 00:23:37.290
I already made it this far, after all.

00:23:46.220 --> 00:23:50.230
Shizuka has come home.
She has come for Rui Hanazawa.

00:23:50.830 --> 00:23:53.030
He always acted like
he could care less...

00:23:53.100 --> 00:23:55.200
but there's a gentle smile
on his face now.

00:23:55.730 --> 00:23:58.700
I guess I have to change, too.

00:23:59.700 --> 00:24:02.300
What? They're looking for
exchange students?

00:24:02.940 --> 00:24:04.110
And on top of it, it's free!

00:24:04.770 --> 00:24:07.840
Hana Yori Dango: "Study Abroad?!"
